{"name":"Lannister Red","hex":"#cd0101","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"red","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The color of the setting sun, blood, and strawberries; the color which is evoked by the longest visible wavelengths (between about 625–740 nm), and a primary additive color.","A revolutionary socialist or (most commonly) a Communist;  a Bolshevik, a supporter of the Bolsheviks in the Russian Civil War."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a red hue.","Having an orange-brown or orange-blond colour; ginger."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/red"}],"entries":[{"title":"List of A Song of Ice and Fire characters","blocks":[{"text":"George R. R. Martin's A Song of Ice and Fire saga features a large cast of characters. The series follows three interwoven plotlines: a dynastic war for control of Westeros by several families; the rising threat of the Others beyond the northern border of Westeros; and the ambition of Daenerys Targaryen, the exiled heir of the previous ruling dynasty. In Martin's fictional world, the Great Houses of Westeros represent the Seven Kingdoms which exist on the continent: the North, the Iron Islands, the Vale of Arryn, the Westerlands, the Stormlands, the Reach, and Dorne. A massive wall of ice and old magic separates the Seven Kingdoms from the largely unmapped area in the most northern portion of the continent."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_A_Song_of_Ice_and_Fire_characters","wikidata":"Q2728258"},{"title":"Red","blocks":[{"text":"Red is the color at the long wavelength end of the visible spectrum of light, next to orange and opposite violet. It has a dominant wavelength of approximately 625–750 nanometers. It is a primary color in the RGB color model and a secondary color in the CMYK color model, and is the complementary color of cyan. Reds range from the brilliant yellow-tinged scarlet and vermillion to bluish-red crimson, and vary in shade from the pale red pink to the dark red burgundy."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg/330px-Delicious_fresh_strawberries_%284735910403%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red","wikidata":"Q3142"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Stark_CoA.png/500px-Stark_CoA.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Stark_CoA.png/500px-Stark_CoA.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coat of arms of House Stark (Argent, a direwolf courant cendrée)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStark_CoA.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/House_Targaryen.png/500px-House_Targaryen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/House_Targaryen.png/1280px-House_Targaryen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/House_Targaryen.png/500px-House_Targaryen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coat of arms of House Targaryen  (Sable, a dragon thrice-headed gules flammant of the last)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHouse_Targaryen.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/A_Song_of_Ice_and_Fire_arms_of_House_Payne.png/250px-A_Song_of_Ice_and_Fire_arms_of_House_Payne.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/A_Song_of_Ice_and_Fire_arms_of_House_Payne.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/w